itcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163539229,"discussion_id":"a18cf5240c4bc7998f58619c51da67b51862e064","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-25T18:32:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-25T18:32:28+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163539236,"discussion_id":"14d0acbb0d239b8c6eeec609725fcd92b584e10a","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复广播工具函数中因变量名错误导致的潜在逻辑问题。在特定条件下，用于计算NDDMA偏移量的函数使用了错误的数组参数，可能导致内存访问偏移计算错误，进而影响数据复制的正确性，存在引发数据损坏或程序行为异常的风险。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改 `BroadcastNddmaWithLoopContiguousFuseAxis` 函数内部的三处变量引用，将原本指向原始维度/步长数组的指针更正为指向内部重构后数组的正确指针。这确保了在后续的关键函数调用中，使用的是经过连续轴融合处理后的正确维度与步长信息，从而保证数据复制偏移量的计算准确无误。","created_at":"2026-02-25T18:32:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-25T18:32:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163567454,"discussion_id":"6cbd663a8699bd6733279feef4d4a5e2a2c0bedb","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-26T09:24:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-26T09:24:42+08:00","user":{"id":"68d8a3941cd4be6766a98970","login":"gcw_O7A9kyAn","object_id":"68d8a3941cd4be6766a98970","name":"gcw_O7A9kyAn","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_O7A9kyAn"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":163567519,"discussion_id":"789946785973b5